  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "77F2E874C0CC2E21",
      "text": "¿Qué tal, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "77F2E574C0CC2908",
      "text": "Veo que hasta ahora has capturado [VAR 0x0202(0001)] especie[VAR 0x1105(0001,0100,0001)]ss\\nde Pokémon en la comarca de Noroteo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0202",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 4,
          "code_hex": "1105",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100",
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "77F2E674C0CC2ABB",
      "text": "¡Bueno, el campamento acaba de empezar!\\c\\nTe animo a encontrar un montón de Pokémon\\nexclusivos de Noroteo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "77F2EB74C0CC333A",
      "text": "Naturalmente, los Pokémon que habitan un lugar\\ncon un clima tan distinto también son diferentes.\\c\\nComo los veranos de Noroteo son muy húmedos,\\nabundan los Pokémon que prefieren la humedad.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "77F2EC74C0CC34ED",
      "text": "En las alturas del Monte Ogro verás fumarolas,\\nes decir, gases volcánicos que salen de la tierra.\\c\\nA los Pokémon que prefieren entornos gaseosos\\ndebe de parecerles un lugar muy acogedor...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 190,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05_02",
      "hash64": "CC6D265DB8C2E240",
      "text": "Procura no ir respirando a pleno pulmón en esos\\nsitios, ¿eh?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "77F2E974C0CC2FD4",
      "text": "¡Guau, si ya casi has completado la Pokédex\\nde Noroteo!\\c\\nMira la Pokédex para comprobar los hábitats o\\nhaz alguna teraincursión en una cueva cristalina.\\c\\nNo cejes en tu empeño, que ya estás muy cerca\\nde la meta, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. ¡Ánimo![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 154,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 216,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 229,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "77F2EA74C0CC3187",
      "text": "No me digas que... ¡has conseguido registrar\\ntodas las especies![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "77F2DF74C0CC1ED6",
      "text": "¡Eso significa que has completado la Pokédex!\\n¡Guau! ¡Es un logro realmente impresionante![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "77F2E074C0CC2089",
      "text": "¡Gracias a ti, creo que puedo dar por concluida\\nmi investigación sobre los Pokémon de Noroteo![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "77F66D74C0CF45F7",
      "text": "Me gustaría darte algo a modo de celebración,\\npero una cosa que tenga ahora así a mano...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "77F66C74C0CF4444",
      "text": "¡Ah, ya sé![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_25",
      "hash64": "77EC5874C0C6CDC3",
      "text": "Te regalaré este souvenir de edición limitada\\nque me compré en el centro cultural.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "77F66F74C0CF495D",
      "text": "Vale, y ahora... ¿podrías mostrarme un momento\\ntu SmartRotom?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "77F66E74C0CF47AA",
      "text": "Para conmemorar tu hito, te voy a instalar en la\\naplicación Pokédex la función de diploma que\\r\\nha creado el director Clavel.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "77F66974C0CF3F2B",
      "text": "También recibirás un mensaje por parte de la\\ncompañía certificadora de la Pokédex.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "77F66874C0CF3D78",
      "text": "Debes saber, sin embargo, que este campamento\\naún puede dar mucho de sí.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "77F66B74C0CF4291",
      "text": "Sigue así y no dejes de descubrir todo tipo de\\ncosas sobre los Pokémon de Noroteo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "77F66A74C0CF40DE",
      "text": "¡Hace un tiempo estupendo hoy! Qué gustirrinín\\nempezar el día con esta frescura matutina.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "77F66574C0CF385F",
      "text": "El verano de Noroteo es de un húmedo que no\\nveas... Estoy sudando la gota gorda bajo la bata.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "77F66474C0CF36AC",
      "text": "El atardecer de Noroteo es bien bonito.\\c\\nTiene una tonalidad más pálida que el de Paldea.\\n¿Será por el índice de refracción de la luz solar?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "77EC5B74C0C6D2DC",
      "text": "Si lo vas a dar todo durante horas intempestivas,\\n¡alza la mirada hacia el cielo de vez en cuando!\\c\\nHay tan poca contaminación lumínica aquí que\\nel firmamento se contempla en toda su gloria.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 192,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "77EC5C74C0C6D48F",
      "text": "Hemos comenzado el día con un chaparrón.\\c\\nSeguro que los Pokémon a los que les gusta\\nla lluvia están felices como unas castañuelas.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "77EC5D74C0C6D642",
      "text": "El verano de Noroteo no da tregua. Incluso en\\nun día lluvioso no te libras del calor sofocante.\\c\\nEste tipo de clima debe de ejercer su influencia\\ntambién en los ecosistemas de la zona.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 186,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "77EC5E74C0C6D7F5",
      "text": "Una tarde pasada por agua, ¿eh?\\c\\nTen cuidado, que la temperatura corporal baja\\nsin apenas darte cuenta cuando te empapas.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "77EC5774C0C6CC10",
      "text": "Esta noche es traicionera: hay poca visibilidad\\ny el terreno ha quedado fangoso por la lluvia.\\c\\nSerá mejor que no te alejes mucho explorando.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_stop",
      "hash64": "476DB22077BD9036",
      "text": "Intenta registrar 200 especies de Pokémon\\ndiferentes en la Pokédex de Noroteo, ¿vale?\\c\\nCuando las registres todas, pulsa el [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]botón X[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] en\\nla Pokédex para recibir el sello que certifica\\r\\nque la has completado y ven a enseñármelo.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
